=== Note ===
No transcript from the original setup/tracer/harvest runs captured wall-clock
timing for the PrimeKG download (setup.log records the pip install phase
only; the KB download happens lazily inside load_skb/load_qa on first use,
observed indirectly via tracer-score-one.log line 2, "Loading from
.../data/prime/processed!"). This command records the on-disk footprint of
the already-downloaded, revision-pinned PrimeKG processed artifact as
observed after Plans 18-01/18-02 completed; install/download wall-clock was
not measured during the spike and is recorded here as an honest gap, not
fabricated.
